{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-start|T6", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Out of gas.", "passage": "gasstation-gas-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Sin gasolina.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-start|T8", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A stupid thing to let happen in general. And utterly asinine in Paris.", "passage": "gasstation-gas-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Una estupidez que puede pasarle a cualquiera. Y una absoluta idiotez en París.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-start|T10", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You sigh and call the closest gas station.", "passage": "gasstation-gas-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Suspiras y llamas a la gasolinera más cercana.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-start|T11", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "…", "passage": "gasstation-gas-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-start|T13", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "An hour later, you pay the gas station attendant his due.", "passage": "gasstation-gas-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Una hora después, le pagas al empleado de la gasolinera lo que corresponde.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-start|T14", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You lost time. Your tank is half full.", "passage": "gasstation-gas-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Perdiste tiempo. Tu tanque está a la mitad.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-start|T15", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You’re ready to go again despite the smirk on the attendant’s face…", "passage": "gasstation-gas-start", "source": "textasset", "es": "Estás listo para seguir a pesar de la sonrisita burlona del empleado…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-ending1|T23", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Who ever heard of a taxi driver who…lets the tank run dry?", "passage": "gasstation-gas-ending1", "source": "textasset", "es": "¿Quién oyó hablar de un taxista que… deja que se le acabe la gasolina?", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-ending2|T28", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He probably recognized you…", "passage": "gasstation-gas-ending2", "source": "textasset", "es": "Probablemente te reconoció…", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
{"id": "966_gasstation_emptygas|gasstation-gas-ending3|T33", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "He knows know one will believe him when he tells them.", "passage": "gasstation-gas-ending3", "source": "textasset", "es": "Sabe que nadie le va a creer cuando lo cuente.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false}
